sequenceDiagram
    participant MF as .machine File
    participant P as Parser
    participant M as Machine Object
    participant G as Generator
    participant S as Strategy
    participant RF as .robot File

    Note over MF,RF: Main Data Flow - From Machine Model to Robot Framework Tests

    MF->>+P: parse() - textual contents
    Note right of P: Line-oriented parsing<br/>or pyparsing grammar
    P->>-M: Machine object created

    M->>+G: generate() - machine object
    G->>+S: Create strategy instance<br/>(depth-first, random, all-pairs)
    S->>G: Generate test sequences<br/>with variable assignments
    S->>-G: Return action sequences
    
    G->>G: Write Robot Framework output<br/>(Settings, Variables, Test Cases, Keywords)
    G->>-RF: Write final .robot file
    Note right of RF: Complete Robot Framework<br/>test suite generated
